Pick what to send without guessing from icons and a bar. Better Trade shows how the trader values your items and how much each item contributes when you send supplies, donate, or fill a delivery request.

[size=5]Main features[/size]
[list]
[*][b]Trade values & prices:[/b] see item values, trader bonuses and reductions, and the totals for your offer and selected goods.[/*]
[*][b]Supplies and deliveries:[/b] see how much your items add. Items that add nothing appear dimmed.[/*]
[*][b]Delivery requests:[/b] track progress with bars and item icons. Hover for item details. Preview rewards, or disable the previews.[/*]
[*][b]Sort by value:[/b] show higher numbers first for the current mode. Items keep their actual positions in storage.[/*]
[*][b]Item tooltips:[/b] see uses, food stats, book effects, seed crops, and how the game calculates trade value.[/*]
[*][b]Trading tag:[/b] mark home storage with Trading to add its tab to the trade window. Move items directly to the drone.[/*]
[/list]

In supply, donation, and delivery request modes, items with no contribution to the displayed number are dimmed. Dimming does not prevent you from sending them.

[size=5]Requirements[/size]
[list]
[*]Survival Log 1.1.18293 or later.[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/survivallog/mods/12]BepInEx for Survival Log[/url]. Install it first.[/*]
[/list]

[size=5]Installation[/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/survivallog/mods/12]BepInEx[/url] [i](if no other mods were installed before, start the game once so BepInEx finishes setup, then quit)[/i].[/*]
[*]Extract this mod's zip into the game folder (the folder with the game .exe). The DLL lands in BepInEx\plugins. Full path example:
[code]C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Survival Log\BepInEx\plugins\BetterTrade.dll[/code]
[/*]
[/list]

[size=5]Uninstall[/size]
Delete [font=Courier New]BetterTrade.dll[/font] from the [font=Courier New]BepInEx\plugins[/font] folder.

[size=5]Configuration[/size]
To change mod settings, edit [font=Courier New]BepInEx\config\com.ivmakk.survivallog.bettertrade.cfg[/font] while the game is closed (see [url=https://github.com/ivmakk-sl/sl-better-trade/blob/main/CONFIG.md]CONFIG.md[/url] for every setting). Changes apply at the next game start.

